 "description": "T1133 (D1): seeded bad values for docs/wire.schema.json. Each case changes one value of continent-app/scripts/ci/fixtures/contract-min.json (set `value`, or `delete` the key at `path`); the validator must then report exactly `expect`, the field path first. tests/test_wire_contract.py (pipeline) and continent-app/tests/wire-contract.test.mjs (app) run the same cases, so a break fails both with the same message. T1143 (D3): a case marked `pipeline_fills` is a missing provenance stamp, which atomic_write_json fills (provenance.stamp_payload) instead of refusing; the validators and the CI gate still reject it.",
